			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"孟丹"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10210801,
					"content": "多謝閣下出手相救，否則我就要爛在牢裡了！那些盜寶團，心情好就修剪一下那幾盆甜甜花，心情不好就修理一下我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210802
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210802,
					"content": "小事一樁~小事一樁~千萬~不要太感謝我們哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210803,
					"content": "哈哈…我明白我明白，謝禮自當備上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210804,
					"content": "真的不用了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210805
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10210805,
					"content": "別這麼說！多虧了您，我才能逃過一劫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210806,
					"content": "我是璃月港內「明星齋」的供應商，孟丹，平時常在山裡走動，四處搜集古董。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210807,
					"content": "沒想到這回跟盜寶團看上了同一座遺蹟，一不小心…就被抓住關起來了，唉！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210808,
					"content": "這位恩人，您手頭還缺什麼嗎？古董、珍玩、各色擺設…只要您要，只要我有！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210809,
					"content": "好意我心領了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10210810,
					"content": "等等，我們確實在找一件東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210811,
					"content": "哦？是什麼東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210812
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210812,
					"content": "有沒有可以裝禮物的盒子？要漂亮一些的…嗯，用來放點心的那種。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210813,
					"content": "這當然有，做古玩的怎麼能不備禮盒？<color=#00E1FFFF>「明星齋」</color>裡自有七國第一流的送禮包裝。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210814,
					"content": "您等著，我去跟老闆打個招呼。您什麼時候需要，到店裡直接找她就行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10210815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "孟丹"
				},
				{
					"id": 10210815,
					"content": "太好了，我們的「糖霜史萊姆」有豪華包裝盒啦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 102111,
			"completionStepIds": [
				102111
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"102111",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 102111,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
