			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"星稀"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 10211101,
					"content": "妳好，有個叫孟丹的人說，我們可以來店裡領一個漂亮盒子…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211102,
					"content": "#老孟都跟我說了，二位，真是多虧{F#妳}{M#你}們相救。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211103,
					"content": "我店裡最好的那些貨品，許多都是老孟搜集來的。萬一他有個三長兩短，我的生意也做不下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211104,
					"content": "來，這禮盒本身就是古物，起碼有一百四十年的歷史，已經洗淨備好了。請過目…還合適嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211105,
					"content": "可以可以，非常合適！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211106,
					"content": "對了，可以再借用一樣東西嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211107,
					"content": "當然。東西都在架子上，您隨意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211108,
					"content": "旅行者，這個大陶罐看起來很厲害！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211109,
					"content": "用古董做攪拌盆，做出來的點心一定好吃！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211110,
					"content": "做好了！獨一無二的糖霜史萊姆！把它小心翼翼地擺進禮盒，點綴一些糖粉…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211111,
					"content": "這有剛摘下的鮮花，擺兩朵吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "星稀"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211112,
					"content": "太好了，真漂亮！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10211113,
					"content": "（不知怎麼，有點心虛…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10211114
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10211114,
					"content": "好，我們的榮華富貴都在這個盒子裡了。現在就去「群玉閣」找凝光吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
